<title class="- topic/title ">kitControl-LessThan</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component performs the operation: <codeph class="+ topic/ph pr-d/codeph ">A &lt; B</codeph> with a Boolean result.</shortdesc>
<prolog class="- topic/prolog ">
<metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">LessThan</indexterm></keywords>
</metadata>
</prolog>
<refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody ">
<section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">LessThan is available in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Logic</uicontrol> folder of the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">kitControl</apiname> palette.</p><fig class="- topic/fig ">
<title class="- topic/title ">LesstThan properties</title>
